Creating virtual environment: python -m venv venv
Activate (mac): source venv/bin/activate
Packages to install: pip install torch torchvision numpy matplotlib
Right folder: cd dissertation_stream_simulator
Run: python baseline_offline.py
Run: python baseline_naive_online.py




Files:
1. models.py - Simple CNN to run MNIST
2. utils.py - Helper function
3. baseline_offline.py - Never updates after initial running
4. baseline_naive_online.py - Updates on every batch